# Firebase — do NOT publish the merged production ruleset to a public repo.
# firestore.rules here contains the whole project's (school-manager) rules,
# which are only kept locally as the deploy source. Regenerate/deploy from a
# machine with `firebase` access; never commit it to a public assignment repo.
firestore.rules
.firebaserc
